<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    57.85		vs	   66.49</p>
<p> Operating	   10.02		vs	    9.96</p>
<p> Current	    959    million	  vs	    1.98</p>
<p> Net		    1.12		vs	  855    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.00 yen	  vs	    2.29 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    374 million	  vs	 374 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.00 yen	  vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkaido Bank Ltd is a regional bank serving Hokkaido.</p>
</text>
